# ── Credentials: never commit ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# A meta.ai cookie export carries `ecto_1_sess`, a live session — anyone
# holding it is logged in as you. Re-exporting produces `cookies (1).json` and
# friends, so the patterns are deliberately wide. A .har is worse still: it has
# full Cookie headers AND the `ecto1:` access token in the gateway URL.
/secrets/
*cookies*.json
cookies*.json
auth*.json
token*.json
session*.json
secrets*.json
*.cookies
*.cookie
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.har
*.pem
*.key

# ── Local / agent tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
.remember/
.cursor/
.aider*
.idea/
.vscode/
CLAUDE.md

# ── Generated artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
output/
tests/output/
examples/example-image.*
*.log

# ── OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
